  - collision checking
  - research data
  - VLA data preparation
abstract: >-
  Archived research data supporting visual modeling and collision-guided
  trajectory repair for industrial manipulators. The collection includes
  complete offline input and outcome records, failed and successful candidates,
  source-augmented and independent-random trajectory experiments, small modeling
  and programming-efficiency studies, and a limited recorded hardware sample.
  It is not a training-ready VLA dataset. New collision-optimization source code
  and its execution environment are not included.
